1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:03,306
[Characters, places and incidents
in this production]

2
00:00:03,306 --> 00:00:06,650
[are entirely fictitious.]

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:09,956
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

4
00:00:59,377 --> 00:01:01,320
<i>You two were apart for more than ten years,</i>

5
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:03,040
<i>then suddenly met again.</i>

6
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,760
<i>It must have happened for a reason.</i>

7
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,085
<i>How do I convince you, then?</i>

8
00:01:06,085 --> 00:01:07,800
<i>Marry Nana,</i>

9
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,970
<i>and I'll believe you!</i>

10
00:01:08,970 --> 00:01:11,920
<i>I'll just keep being a thorn in your side</i>

11
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:14,000
<i>until you finally give up.</i>

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,290
<i>Is that Mr. Alex's girlfriend?
He gets so close to her.</i>

13
00:01:16,290 --> 00:01:18,037
<i>He has never done this to anyone.</i>

14
00:01:18,037 --> 00:01:20,107
<i>What will you do if you meet him?</i>

15
00:01:20,107 --> 00:01:21,640
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

16
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:24,520
<i>I'll just fulfill my duty as best as I can.</i>

17
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:31,720
[Education Level]
[High School: S.A.R.]

18
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:34,150
[Mr. Danai Kaewkaruna]
[Occupation: Student]

19
00:01:34,150 --> 00:01:36,360
[Miss Daranee Kaewkaruna]
[Occupation: Student]

20
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,960
- This way, Ms. Ran.
- Okay.

21
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:06,280
If everything's done, I'm going to go now.

22
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,360
Thank you.

23
00:02:17,176 --> 00:02:19,174
The minimart zombie girl?

24
00:02:19,174 --> 00:02:20,240
Right.

25
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:23,200
That's the girl who swept me off my feet.

26
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:25,800
So, she works at a minimart, right?

27
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,000
And that day,

28
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,880
she caught a thief with this move.

29
00:02:31,974 --> 00:02:33,394
She was so cool.

30
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,720
That hit me right in the heart.

31
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,040
And then,

32
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,210
later,

33
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:41,800
I went back to the minimart to see her,

34
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,560
but I couldn't find her.

35
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,800
But then, just now...

36
00:02:46,090 --> 00:02:47,440
I saw her.

37
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,360
Is this destiny? Is it?

38
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,400
Wait a minute.

39
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:54,948
Your minimart zombie girl
works as a security guard here?

40
00:02:54,948 --> 00:02:55,987
That's right.

41
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,635
And?

42
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,880
Yai,

43
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,720
can you take care of her for me?

44
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,680
Do you think I'm not busy enough

45
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:08,040
that you want me to mentor a security guard?

46
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,785
It's not like that.

47
00:03:10,785 --> 00:03:12,120
I just...

48
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,175
What?

49
00:03:13,175 --> 00:03:15,169
Hurry up.
I have a meeting coming up.

50
00:03:15,169 --> 00:03:17,160
And you'll have to read
the script with the team.

51
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,800
Learn how to prioritize.

52
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:22,269
Making a girl your top priority like this
can ruin your life.

53
00:03:23,664 --> 00:03:25,440
I'm fine with your long speech,

54
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:27,180
but I can't stand your complaining.

55
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,800
Okay, how about this?

56
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:33,205
I just want her

57
00:03:33,205 --> 00:03:35,385
to work here without any problems

58
00:03:36,013 --> 00:03:37,313
and stay for a long time.

59
00:03:37,874 --> 00:03:39,089
That's it!

60
00:03:39,089 --> 00:03:40,520
If she works well

61
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,720
and doesn't cause any problems,

62
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:43,760
that's it for me too.

63
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,623
Get out.

64
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,461
Hello.

65
00:04:06,461 --> 00:04:07,920
Uncle Narong, it's me.

66
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,680
Can I have the files on
the new security guards?

67
00:04:11,410 --> 00:04:13,990
Yes, sure. Of course.

68
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,240
[Application Form]

69
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,040
[Position: Security Officer]

70
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:51,309
There's only one female security guard,

71
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:53,720
so it has to be this one.

72
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:56,200
[Miss Thawin Sapkert]

73
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,360
Does Sam like tough women now?

74
00:05:13,061 --> 00:05:14,190
Hello,

75
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:16,625
I'm Narong from the Security Department.

76
00:05:16,625 --> 00:05:19,920
Please make sure
everything goes smoothly for Ms. Thawin.

77
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,754
But you treat everyone well, right?

78
00:05:25,731 --> 00:05:26,900
Let's just say

79
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:30,600
treat everyone equally as usual.

80
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,320
No one is privileged.

81
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,326
Yes, sir!

82
00:06:04,847 --> 00:06:06,360
Are you surprised

83
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,027
that I cook?

84
00:06:08,027 --> 00:06:09,240
It saves me money.

85
00:06:09,925 --> 00:06:11,040
You can eat now.

86
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,480
What about you?

87
00:06:14,330 --> 00:06:15,330
I've already eaten.

88
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:22,136
Give it a try and see if it tastes good.

89
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,040
This is good.

90
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,639
Thank you.

91
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,320
Eat lots and lots, okay?

92
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,593
You look too thin.

93
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,440
I am?

94
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,400
As a security guard,

95
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:53,600
you have to be strong and tough.

96
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,569
Okay.

97
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:02,680
Is this really your room?

98
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:05,038
Finish the meal first. Let's talk later.

99
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:25,800
My side job is being a musician at night.

100
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,720
That's why...

101
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:32,780
you have a full set of instruments.

102
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,160
I'm on my own, with no one to worry about.

103
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,226
That's why I have enough money for these.

104
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:42,690
Do you cook every day?

105
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,135
Yes, every day.

106
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,059
That's how I save up for these.

107
00:07:49,215 --> 00:07:50,390
That's great.

108
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,600
I like watching basketball.

109
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,625
You saved enough money to buy a TV

110
00:07:55,625 --> 00:07:57,740
and subscribe to TrueVisions NOW.

111
00:07:57,740 --> 00:07:58,665
That's great.

112
00:07:58,665 --> 00:07:59,355
Yes.

113
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,760
Feel free to use whatever you need.

114
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,934
Don't worry about it.

115
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,045
I mean it.

116
00:08:08,045 --> 00:08:09,480
Don't worry about it.

117
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,963
You're so generous.

118
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,393
Thank you so much.

119
00:08:28,822 --> 00:08:29,840
Oh!

120
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,040
There's no need to turn on the A/C.
It's a waste.

121
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,041
It's free.

122
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,320
Free?

123
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,932
It's one of our benefits,

124
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,440
so you can sleep well.

125
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,600
Is the electricity bill free?

126
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,652
Yes.

127
00:08:43,652 --> 00:08:45,182
Get some rest today.

128
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,433
Work starts tomorrow.

129
00:08:47,433 --> 00:08:49,080
Today is also my day off,

130
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:52,110
so I'll be practicing music
to perform at a pub tonight.

131
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,950
Can you stay alone?

132
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,040
Yes, I can.

133
00:08:57,960 --> 00:09:00,892
So, thank you again.

134
00:09:00,892 --> 00:09:02,880
Stop thanking me.

135
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:05,833
Don't worry about it. We're coworkers.

136
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,380
Ran.

137
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,400
Can I just call you

138
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,640
"Ran"?

139
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,120
Of course, Mr. Alex.

140
00:09:19,768 --> 00:09:22,760
You can also drop the word "Mister."

141
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,120
Okay,

142
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,720
Alex.

143
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,449
So... Make yourself at home.

144
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,972
Oh.

145
00:09:40,972 --> 00:09:43,320
I'll work on a song for a bit.

146
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,000
Do you mind if there's some music?

147
00:09:45,894 --> 00:09:47,683
It's totally fine.

148
00:09:47,683 --> 00:09:49,360
I like music.

149
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,920
Rest well, then.

150
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:40,440
<i>♪ You're a gift sent from heaven ♪</i>

151
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:48,165
<i>♪ I'll cherish this blessing forevermore ♪</i>

152
00:10:48,165 --> 00:10:51,740
<i>♪ I won't let anything bring you harm ♪</i>

153
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:57,040
<i>♪ As long as I'm right here, ♪</i>

154
00:10:57,040 --> 00:11:00,960
<i>♪ I'll love you with all my heart, dear ♪</i>

155
00:11:02,611 --> 00:11:03,821
Sam.

156
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,400
- Hello.
- Sam.

157
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:08,580
Sam!

158
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:11,640
- Sam!
- Sam!

159
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,600
Can I get a selfie with you?

160
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,290
Can I get a selfie with you?

161
00:11:20,981 --> 00:11:22,000
Sam!

162
00:11:23,114 --> 00:11:24,720
[Sam Ronnaphob]

163
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,920
Dao!

164
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:27,396
You remember me?

165
00:11:27,396 --> 00:11:28,946
Can I get a selfie with you?

166
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,570
- Right.
- Whoa!

167
00:11:33,570 --> 00:11:34,640
[Luknut]
I'm not done yet!

168
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,860
Can I get a selfie with you?

169
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:37,720
Luknut! Sam!

170
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,300
Can I get a selfie with you?

171
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:40,140
- Sam!
- Kitty kiss, please.

172
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:41,680
- Luknut!
- Kitty kiss?

173
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:59,240
I signed this especially for someone special.

174
00:11:59,834 --> 00:12:01,200
Thank you, Sam!

175
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:06,971
My life as a shipper is complete!

176
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,240
What does that mean?

177
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:12,200
It means that... I am very happy.

178
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,720
I don't need anything else.

179
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:15,925
I can finally die with a smile on my face.

180
00:12:15,925 --> 00:12:16,920
Look.

181
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,560
What are you doing here so early?

182
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:22,364
I have to get here
before they attend acting class.

183
00:12:22,364 --> 00:12:24,120
Don't you have a class?

184
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,960
The exams are over,
and it's semester break now.

185
00:12:28,610 --> 00:12:29,610
I forgot about that.

186
00:12:30,590 --> 00:12:33,520
If there's anything important,
you can just call me.

187
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:36,100
I have three minutes
before reporting for duty.

188
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:37,190
Say it.

189
00:12:37,190 --> 00:12:38,190
Come here.

190
00:12:39,500 --> 00:12:41,000
So...

191
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,279
I'll join the photography club next semester.

192
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:45,640
I've saved up for a camera,
but I still need some more.

193
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:48,720
Can you help me, please, please, please?

194
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,200
If I called you,

195
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:53,320
you wouldn't be able to see my eyes.

196
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,920
Please, please, please?

197
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:05,990
Your sister is so adorable.

198
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,640
She learned to save money

199
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:09,920
and knows how to sweet-talk.

200
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,400
She really does.

201
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,240
She's no ordinary girl.

202
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:16,182
You seem to really love your sister.

203
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:18,473
Did you eavesdrop on us?

204
00:13:18,473 --> 00:13:20,360
She was loud enough

205
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,920
to reach the guardhouse.

206
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,960
I made a promise to Dao

207
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:27,000
that if she wants expensive things,

208
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,600
she'll have to help me save money.

209
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,720
If she wants me to buy her everything,

210
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,620
I can't possibly do that.

211
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:33,960
That's great.

212
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,596
She'll learn the value of things

213
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:38,080
and know that they're not easy to get.

214
00:13:40,463 --> 00:13:41,560
I should...

215
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,030
get to work now.

216
00:13:43,030 --> 00:13:45,120
I can't be late on my first day.

217
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,200
See you, then.

218
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:50,880
Hey. Did you do this?

219
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,040
What is it?

220
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:55,440
Are you the reason Yai brought Luknut
into the company?

221
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,910
I never said anything.

222
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,000
That zombie girl?

223
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:32,740
Hello.

224
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:33,840
Can we take a photo?

225
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,160
Can I take a photo with you?

226
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:37,510
Why did you follow me?

227
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:39,550
I didn't follow you. I'm following her.

228
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:41,230
- Sam...
- Can I take a picture with you?

229
00:14:41,230 --> 00:14:42,158
Let's take a photo.

230
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:43,750
Excuse me.

231
00:14:43,750 --> 00:14:45,300
- Can I?
- Take a photo first. Come on.

232
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:46,260
Smile.

233
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:52,712
You've got the layout down now, right?

234
00:14:52,712 --> 00:14:53,700
Yes.

235
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:56,800
Good. I'll take you to
your assigned post, then.

236
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:58,000
- Yes.
- This way.

237
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,680
Where's Mr. Rangsiman?

238
00:15:35,680 --> 00:15:36,880
He already went back.

239
00:15:37,965 --> 00:15:39,230
What about Daran?

240
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:47,600
Ms. Natasha, you can't get in there.

241
00:15:48,259 --> 00:15:49,526
Why can't I?

242
00:15:49,526 --> 00:15:52,020
Mr. Rangsiman asked not to be disturbed.

243
00:15:52,020 --> 00:15:53,210
But it's me.

244
00:15:53,210 --> 00:15:56,030
I know, but Mr. Rangsiman ordered me...

245
00:15:56,030 --> 00:15:58,259
not to let anyone in there at all.

246
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:05,790
Why are you laughing?

247
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:09,399
Why does it bother you
that Yai is talking to a mere security guard?

248
00:16:10,527 --> 00:16:11,667
Do you know

249
00:16:12,377 --> 00:16:14,267
who that security guard is?

250
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,704
She's someone I brought here.

251
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:21,400
And now, Yai is giving her special treatment,

252
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,920
just as I asked.

253
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:26,186
She is Yai's ex, you fool.

254
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,058
What?

255
00:16:41,752 --> 00:16:44,110
You left me because
you wanted a bright future.

256
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:48,424
And is this all your bright future amounts to?

257
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:53,182
You should've gone further.

258
00:16:53,182 --> 00:16:55,290
Why are you back in my life?

259
00:16:57,853 --> 00:16:58,780
Answer me.

260
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:00,800
Money, sir.

261
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,071
I'm here to work for money.

262
00:17:05,232 --> 00:17:06,520
That's it.

263
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:08,640
I didn't want to come into your life.

264
00:17:09,339 --> 00:17:10,681
You didn't want to,

265
00:17:12,367 --> 00:17:14,071
but you're still involved in it

266
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,880
because this is my workplace,

267
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:19,120
and I'm the one who pays you.

268
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:23,501
The very same person you said
had nothing left.

269
00:17:27,397 --> 00:17:30,377
I signed the contract
to work as a security guard,

270
00:17:30,377 --> 00:17:33,600
not to stand here for you
to insult and look down upon.

271
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:35,626
Why? You can't stand this?

272
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,743
Are you done?

273
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:41,600
If so, please allow me to get back to work.

274
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:44,065
You still dare to work here?

275
00:17:48,974 --> 00:17:50,538
Do you really need money?

276
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,092
Yes, sir.

277
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,520
How much?

278
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:02,288
How much to get out of my life?

279
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,200
Back off!

280
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,528
You can't get in.

281
00:18:17,528 --> 00:18:20,320
If you're not backing off, I'll slap you.

282
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,665
I'll take that.

283
00:18:21,665 --> 00:18:23,050
Ugh!

284
00:18:23,050 --> 00:18:25,388
If you're not backing off,
I'll kiss you.

285
00:18:25,388 --> 00:18:26,360
I'll take that.

286
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:34,320
- No one's allowed in here.
- Why?

287
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:37,000
Are you trying to rekindle an old flame?

288
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:44,280
Weren't you the outstanding student,
the scholarship kid,

289
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:46,570
and the future national athlete?

290
00:18:48,059 --> 00:18:49,800
And now you're a security guard?

291
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,120
What do you want?

292
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,400
Money.

293
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,926
You get close to Yai
to make him let his guard down

294
00:19:00,715 --> 00:19:02,520
to trick him out of his money?

295
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:04,278
You're so money-hungry.

296
00:19:04,278 --> 00:19:05,500
Yes,

297
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:06,755
I'm money-hungry.

298
00:19:07,368 --> 00:19:10,688
But I only want my salary and nothing else.

299
00:19:10,688 --> 00:19:11,890
I don't believe you.

300
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:15,329
Don't let her fool you
over and over again, Yai.

301
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:19,193
Falling for her just once

302
00:19:19,193 --> 00:19:20,560
is dumb enough.

303
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:21,760
I can think for myself.

304
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:23,171
If you can,

305
00:19:23,171 --> 00:19:24,560
why do you let her stand here?

306
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:26,000
Why don't you kick her out?

307
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,780
Nobody can fire my girl.

308
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,880
Who's your girl?

309
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,960
You are.

310
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:39,185
You're not mine yet, but you'll be soon.

311
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:41,959
Someone who looks like this?

312
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:44,670
Is this not too much?

313
00:19:46,654 --> 00:19:47,920
You're the one

314
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,795
who's doing too much.

315
00:19:49,795 --> 00:19:51,000
I'm a human being.

316
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,200
My girl...

317
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:54,480
is also a human being.

318
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:57,680
And I didn't even do anything.

319
00:20:00,037 --> 00:20:02,840
I don't even know what her name is.

320
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:06,365
The only thing I know

321
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,201
is that I've given her all of my heart.

322
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,200
It's called being sincere.

323
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,290
Do you understand?

324
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,160
"Sincere."

325
00:20:16,160 --> 00:20:17,960
That's nonsense.

326
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:20,720
If you want to hit it and quit it,
just tell her that.

327
00:20:24,196 --> 00:20:25,410
Seriously, though.

328
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:28,080
She's Yai's leftovers.

329
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:29,000
You don't mind?

330
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,774
Yeah.

331
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:37,040
Did you ask me if I'm okay with that?

332
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:39,560
You might not be okay for now, but...

333
00:20:40,437 --> 00:20:42,737
you'll be soon, right?

334
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:48,120
Hey...

335
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:49,866
What is wrong with all of you?

336
00:20:50,883 --> 00:20:53,040
How could you mistake scum for gold?

337
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:54,694
Yai,

338
00:20:54,694 --> 00:20:57,280
- she's already causing trouble--
- Are you finished?

339
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:58,840
If you must talk, take it outside.

340
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,760
Yai,

341
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:04,520
let me set something straight.

342
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:07,320
I don't care about your past with her,

343
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:09,680
but you're her employer now.

344
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:12,140
Don't take advantage of her

345
00:21:12,769 --> 00:21:14,499
and don't abuse your authority.

346
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,200
Otherwise...

347
00:21:17,280 --> 00:21:19,000
I'm terminating the contract.

348
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,968
Are you threatening me?

349
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:23,850
Yes.

350
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:29,600
Look at how much I'm protecting you.

351
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:30,983
Will you agree to be my girl now?

352
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:33,436
- No.
- Enough!

353
00:21:39,688 --> 00:21:42,080
If I fire you...

354
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:44,230
Even though I haven't done anything wrong?

355
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:47,200
I'll report you to Labor,

356
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,680
the media, and the court.

357
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:51,080
I'll do whatever I can.

358
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:53,046
I didn't say that I was going to fire you.

359
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:57,022
I just want to know what
kind of person you are right now.

360
00:21:57,714 --> 00:21:59,224
You really won't let go?

361
00:21:59,952 --> 00:22:01,640
Yes,

362
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:03,133
I've got a pretty strong grip.

363
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:15,240
"There are no secrets in the world."

364
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,760
"What's done in the dark..."

365
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:18,360
"will come to light."

366
00:22:18,360 --> 00:22:19,624
Whoa!

367
00:22:19,624 --> 00:22:21,800
Why did you make me say that?

368
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:22,800
I got carried away.

369
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,440
I'm stressed right now.

370
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,780
Mr. Alex's angel might not survive this.

371
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,960
Are you both ready?

372
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:36,895
- Yes.
- Yes.

373
00:22:44,809 --> 00:22:46,108
Hello, sir!

374
00:22:46,108 --> 00:22:48,520
Move Daran as far as possible from my office.

375
00:22:50,184 --> 00:22:52,040
Don't let me see her face

376
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:55,200
or breathe the same air as her.

377
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:56,960
Otherwise, I'll get you

378
00:22:57,600 --> 00:23:00,160
and the one behind this in trouble,

379
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:01,895
<i>and I know who he is.</i>

380
00:23:03,520 --> 00:23:04,650
Yes. Yes, sir.

381
00:23:10,174 --> 00:23:11,235
Yes, yes.

382
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:27,240
I'll open it for you.

383
00:24:12,320 --> 00:24:13,720
What did Yai say?

384
00:24:18,306 --> 00:24:19,610
Mr. Yai...

385
00:24:20,696 --> 00:24:22,600
ordered Ms. Ran...

386
00:24:23,282 --> 00:24:24,810
to be stationed

387
00:24:24,810 --> 00:24:26,810
to the closed floor.

388
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,218
For what?

389
00:24:29,218 --> 00:24:31,920
- Right? I'm also wondering...
- No, Dad...

390
00:24:31,920 --> 00:24:32,880
- What?
- That's too much.

391
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:33,920
- Oh...
- He's your boss.

392
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:35,360
I'm sorry.

393
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,537
Thank you.

394
00:24:48,360 --> 00:24:49,370
Miss Zombie.

395
00:24:49,370 --> 00:24:50,925
[MJTV Broadcasting]

396
00:24:50,925 --> 00:24:53,080
Please stay away from me,

397
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:55,320
or you'll meet the same fate
as that minimart thief.

398
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:15,880
<i>You left me because
you wanted a bright future.</i>

399
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:18,680
<i>And is this all your bright future amounts to?</i>

400
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:40,000
[MJTV Broadcasting]

401
00:26:52,060 --> 00:26:54,256
Why didn't you tell me he's not here?

402
00:26:54,256 --> 00:26:56,040
I couldn't tell you in time.

403
00:26:56,040 --> 00:26:57,665
Where is Yai?

404
00:26:57,665 --> 00:26:59,280
He's working out.

405
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:00,440
At this time?

406
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:02,067
Yes.

407
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:14,400
Why isn't he picking up?

408
00:27:19,440 --> 00:27:21,877
Don't let news about the past relationship

409
00:27:21,877 --> 00:27:25,270
between Yai and Daran get out!

410
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,920
Yes.

411
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:02,598
I'll help you pay for the meal.

412
00:28:02,598 --> 00:28:04,040
It's okay.

413
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:06,200
I couldn't finish this on my own anyway.

414
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:09,540
With your help, the food won't go to waste,
and helps the environment.

415
00:28:11,120 --> 00:28:13,600
Why did you make this much food, then?

416
00:28:13,600 --> 00:28:15,080
I couldn't gauge the right amount.

417
00:28:15,080 --> 00:28:16,120
Let's eat.

418
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:20,720
Why didn't you share this with Boy?

419
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,960
Boy won't eat food like this.

420
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:26,440
He says it's too healthy.

421
00:28:35,132 --> 00:28:36,237
Excuse me.

422
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:39,402
Hello?

423
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:43,120
Sorry, I'm not available right now.

424
00:28:43,800 --> 00:28:45,229
I'll call you back later.

425
00:29:01,080 --> 00:29:02,969
You seem well-educated.

426
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:06,920
You play music professionally, write songs,

427
00:29:07,554 --> 00:29:09,829
and speak multiple languages.

428
00:29:09,829 --> 00:29:11,619
You shouldn't be working as a guard.

429
00:29:15,610 --> 00:29:17,603
Are you saying...

430
00:29:17,603 --> 00:29:19,430
being a security guard

431
00:29:19,430 --> 00:29:21,800
isn't as honorable as other jobs?

432
00:29:24,990 --> 00:29:28,115
Well, there are people who think that way.

433
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:32,310
I believe every job has its value and honor.

434
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:34,353
As long as it's honest work,

435
00:29:34,353 --> 00:29:35,718
I'll do it,

436
00:29:35,718 --> 00:29:37,700
whether it's as a security guard,

437
00:29:38,921 --> 00:29:40,110
a musician,

438
00:29:40,679 --> 00:29:41,800
or an interpreter.

439
00:29:44,984 --> 00:29:46,429
I'm sorry

440
00:29:46,429 --> 00:29:49,854
if I said something that upset you.

441
00:29:49,854 --> 00:29:50,914
It's okay.

442
00:29:52,576 --> 00:29:55,146
And what did the chairman talk to you about?

443
00:29:56,460 --> 00:29:57,460
Oh.

444
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,680
He...

445
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:02,440
thought I was someone Sam brought in.

446
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:04,480
He also made it clear

447
00:30:05,360 --> 00:30:07,488
that nobody gets special treatment.

448
00:30:11,228 --> 00:30:13,280
Can I ask you something?

449
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:15,210
Why did you stop after Grade 12?

450
00:30:15,210 --> 00:30:16,574
Why did you skip university?

451
00:30:20,040 --> 00:30:21,530
My dad passed away,

452
00:30:22,280 --> 00:30:25,225
so I decided not to continue my education

453
00:30:25,225 --> 00:30:27,085
and find work instead.

454
00:30:28,219 --> 00:30:29,854
But I did...

455
00:30:29,854 --> 00:30:32,144
try to study at a public university,

456
00:30:32,869 --> 00:30:34,530
though I must have worked too hard,

457
00:30:34,530 --> 00:30:36,390
so I didn't have the energy to study.

458
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:38,280
So...

459
00:30:38,280 --> 00:30:40,325
I decided not to continue my studies,

460
00:30:40,325 --> 00:30:41,825
and let my siblings continue theirs.

461
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:49,200
That means all this time,

462
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:51,000
you had to work very hard.

463
00:30:54,672 --> 00:30:56,207
Are you exhausted?

464
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:05,800
Let's keep eating.

465
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:09,200
I'll wash the lunch boxes for you in return.

466
00:31:31,960 --> 00:31:33,880
Is the food not to your liking?

467
00:31:36,106 --> 00:31:37,760
I'm just quite stressed.

468
00:31:38,356 --> 00:31:39,440
About what?

469
00:31:42,778 --> 00:31:44,110
- Clean up.
- Yes, ma'am.

470
00:31:47,040 --> 00:31:48,000
Wait...

471
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:51,332
Your stomach's growling.

472
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:56,346
Maybe I just got hungry.

473
00:32:00,723 --> 00:32:01,567
Yai.

474
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:08,020
I have something to say. Have a seat.

475
00:32:08,020 --> 00:32:09,600
- Good evening, Grandma.
- Good evening.

476
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:11,410
Come on, let's eat.

477
00:32:11,410 --> 00:32:12,600
Yes.

478
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:13,920
Serve Yai some rice.

479
00:32:13,920 --> 00:32:15,080
Yes, ma'am.

480
00:32:15,080 --> 00:32:16,360
Get another plate ready.

481
00:32:16,360 --> 00:32:17,800
Lek is going to have dinner with me.

482
00:32:17,800 --> 00:32:18,520
Yes.

483
00:32:22,645 --> 00:32:24,500
What do you want to say, Mother?

484
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:27,560
- I--
- Good evening, Grandma.

485
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:30,450
Auntie.

486
00:32:30,450 --> 00:32:31,880
Yai.

487
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:34,305
Why didn't you answer my call?

488
00:32:34,305 --> 00:32:36,320
It's better that we meet in person.

489
00:32:36,320 --> 00:32:37,730
Let me finish the meal first.

490
00:32:39,080 --> 00:32:39,960
Come here.

491
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:42,400
I had them make your favorite dish.

492
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,740
Thank you, Grandma.

493
00:32:45,676 --> 00:32:47,281
Yai, you look stressed.

494
00:32:47,281 --> 00:32:48,331
Eat a lot.

495
00:32:50,558 --> 00:32:52,000
You too, Auntie.

496
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:53,600
You've gotten thinner.

497
00:32:53,600 --> 00:32:56,080
Last time I saw you, you were much livelier.

498
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:57,999
Really?

499
00:32:57,999 --> 00:33:00,960
Oh, gosh. I think I should
get another IV drip, then.

500
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:04,047
Oh, why spend money on an IV drip?

501
00:33:04,047 --> 00:33:06,790
Why don't you eat healthier?

502
00:33:06,790 --> 00:33:09,040
You're not like Yai and Lek.

503
00:33:09,040 --> 00:33:10,480
They have to use

504
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:13,090
both their brains and their bodies.

505
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:14,961
Come here.

506
00:33:14,961 --> 00:33:17,400
I'll get the food for you. Come on.

507
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,900
I'll get you the food, quick.

508
00:33:18,900 --> 00:33:20,110
Here, give it to me.

509
00:33:20,110 --> 00:33:21,310
Grandma, I don't want veggies.

510
00:33:21,310 --> 00:33:23,400
You have to eat them.

511
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:24,880
Come.

512
00:33:27,002 --> 00:33:28,080
Thank you.

513
00:33:49,735 --> 00:33:51,490
<i>I made chicken soup for you.</i>

514
00:33:51,490 --> 00:33:53,040
<i>Warm it before you eat.</i>

515
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:56,315
<i>Having food that's easy to digest for dinner
is good for your health.</i>

516
00:33:56,315 --> 00:33:59,480
<i>I get off work quite late,
so I'll see you at the building tomorrow.</i>

517
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,650
How sweet.

518
00:34:10,040 --> 00:34:11,160
Lek.

519
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:20,080
Angkhana.

520
00:34:22,271 --> 00:34:23,700
Yes, Mother?

521
00:34:23,700 --> 00:34:25,100
Where are you going?

522
00:34:25,100 --> 00:34:27,320
I have something important
to talk to Yai about.

523
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:29,520
I want you to look at some diamonds with me.

524
00:34:29,520 --> 00:34:32,335
My regular jeweler just sent me a catalog.

525
00:34:32,335 --> 00:34:35,060
Oh, but if you're busy, that's okay.

526
00:34:35,060 --> 00:34:36,040
What a shame.

527
00:34:36,040 --> 00:34:39,041
- I thought I'd buy some--
- I'm free, Mother.

528
00:34:39,041 --> 00:34:40,850
I'll go with you first.

529
00:34:40,850 --> 00:34:43,200
As for Yai,
I can just talk to him at the office.

530
00:34:43,200 --> 00:34:44,230
Let's go.

531
00:34:44,230 --> 00:34:45,166
Come.

532
00:34:45,166 --> 00:34:46,166
Who did it?

533
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:50,157
What are you talking about? I don't understand.

534
00:34:52,200 --> 00:34:53,920
Did I do it?

535
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:56,440
The one who hired Daran
without my knowledge...

536
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:57,480
it's you, right?

537
00:34:59,320 --> 00:35:00,640
Tell me how you did it.

538
00:35:03,904 --> 00:35:05,840
<i>Hire Daran to work here.</i>

539
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,400
<i>A brief interview will do.</i>

540
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:08,500
<i>She can start right away.</i>

541
00:35:09,920 --> 00:35:11,320
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

542
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:13,280
<i>I owe her a lot.</i>

543
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:14,880
<i>I want to take care of her.</i>

544
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:17,360
<i>Do not tell this to anyone,</i>

545
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,662
<i>especially to Yai.</i>

546
00:35:19,662 --> 00:35:20,880
<i>Otherwise,</i>

547
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,551
<i>I'll tell Grandma Namthip.</i>

548
00:35:23,113 --> 00:35:24,240
<i>Mrs. Namthip!</i>

549
00:35:24,240 --> 00:35:25,950
<i>Oh, no.</i>

550
00:35:25,950 --> 00:35:27,600
<i>Please don't tell her.</i>

551
00:35:27,600 --> 00:35:30,628
<i>I won't tell him. I won't say a thing.
I assure you.</i>

552
00:35:30,628 --> 00:35:31,830
<i>Did you upload</i>

553
00:35:31,830 --> 00:35:33,480
<i>Ran's documents?</i>

554
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:35,290
<i>No, I didn't! Not at all.</i>

555
00:35:35,290 --> 00:35:37,800
<i>I'll let you take care of her salary.</i>

556
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:39,400
<i>Do whatever it takes</i>

557
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:40,900
<i>to get the money into her account.</i>

558
00:35:40,900 --> 00:35:41,900
<i>Yeah?</i>

559
00:35:42,560 --> 00:35:43,960
<i>Can you do it?</i>

560
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,130
<i>Yes, I can. Of course.</i>

561
00:35:50,040 --> 00:35:51,720
When do you want the company back?

562
00:35:53,520 --> 00:35:55,920
You already made
all of these decisions without me.

563
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:59,840
Why do you care about something so trivial?

564
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:02,800
Normally, hiring security guards
is Uncle Narong's responsibility.

565
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,880
You know I hate Daran.

566
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,280
But I love Ran.

567
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:08,200
You can't!

568
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:10,400
Who could stop you
from loving Ran back then?

569
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:11,720
Not even your mother could.

570
00:36:12,520 --> 00:36:16,790
Therefore, you can't stop me from
loving Ran, my angel, either.

571
00:36:26,600 --> 00:36:28,460
Hello, I'm Narong from--

572
00:36:28,460 --> 00:36:30,680
<i>Assign Daran to be stationed
outside my room.</i>

573
00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:31,610
Bring me her application,

574
00:36:31,610 --> 00:36:34,060
personal information,
and all supporting documents right away.

575
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:41,615
Everyone wants to protect you.

576
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:43,880
You're too much of a charmer.

577
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:06,710
[Executive Chairman]
[Executive Chairman Advisor]

578
00:37:16,160 --> 00:37:17,200
Is she here?

579
00:37:18,220 --> 00:37:19,800
- Yes?
- Daran.

580
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:21,800
She's here.

581
00:37:23,531 --> 00:37:24,840
Tell her to come in.

582
00:37:25,600 --> 00:37:26,720
Yes.

583
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,840
[Application for Employment]
[Miss Daran Kaewkaruna]

584
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:47,490
[Personal information]

585
00:37:47,490 --> 00:37:48,760
[Family information]

586
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:50,620
[Father: Mr. Chaisak Kaewkaruna, deceased]

587
00:37:50,620 --> 00:37:52,840
[Number of siblings,
including applicant: Three]

588
00:37:55,200 --> 00:37:57,430
[Mr. Danai Kaewkaruna]
[Occupation: Student]

589
00:37:57,430 --> 00:37:59,640
[Ms. Daranee Kaewkaruna]
[Occupation: Student]

590
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:02,920
She has a sister?

591
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:10,990
<i>If I love someone, I'll protect them.</i>

592
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:14,560
<i>Do you know how Ran grew up?</i>

593
00:38:14,560 --> 00:38:16,484
<i>Her father died after high school.</i>

594
00:38:17,100 --> 00:38:18,790
<i>How much she struggled,</i>

595
00:38:18,790 --> 00:38:20,110
<i>and what she went through...</i>

596
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:23,000
<i>I felt sorry for her,</i>

597
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:24,600
<i>so I wanted to help her.</i>

598
00:38:25,810 --> 00:38:28,760
<i>Unlike you, who left her.</i>

599
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:31,000
<i>You don't know enough to say that.</i>

600
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:34,215
<i>Then why don't you tell me
what happened between you and Ran?</i>

601
00:38:34,215 --> 00:38:35,725
<i>Grandma won't say anything as well.</i>

602
00:38:36,320 --> 00:38:38,565
<i>Everyone acted like you and Ran
were never together.</i>

603
00:38:38,565 --> 00:38:39,935
<i>It's none of your business.</i>

604
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:50,857
<i>Does Daran know who you are?</i>

605
00:38:54,598 --> 00:38:55,701
<i>So she doesn't.</i>

606
00:38:56,520 --> 00:38:58,400
<i>And it seems I can't stop you either.</i>

607
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:00,678
<i>I won't interfere,</i>

608
00:39:01,800 --> 00:39:03,080
<i>but stop fooling around</i>

609
00:39:03,080 --> 00:39:05,000
<i>and come back to the station.</i>

610
00:39:06,203 --> 00:39:08,280
<i>I think you'd like MJ Music.</i>

611
00:39:08,280 --> 00:39:10,040
<i>I think you alone are enough, Yai.</i>

612
00:39:10,040 --> 00:39:11,230
<i>I'm not superhuman,</i>

613
00:39:12,516 --> 00:39:14,631
<i>and I'm not the company owner.</i>

614
00:39:14,631 --> 00:39:16,366
<i>I'm taking care of it in your stead,</i>

615
00:39:16,366 --> 00:39:17,960
<i>waiting until you're ready.</i>

616
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:19,190
<i>I'm not ready.</i>

617
00:39:20,240 --> 00:39:22,115
<i>And I see that you can do this alone.</i>

618
00:39:23,160 --> 00:39:24,855
<i>You work like crazy,</i>

619
00:39:25,600 --> 00:39:28,160
<i>like it's either you or
the company that has to die,</i>

620
00:39:28,160 --> 00:39:30,066
<i>or maybe it's for the company's profit.</i>

621
00:39:32,080 --> 00:39:35,080
<i>I think this is why
I don't want to return here.</i>

622
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:42,393
<i>I still want to be happy.</i>

623
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,880
<i>Let me ask you.</i>

624
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:48,160
<i>How are you holding up</i>

625
00:39:48,760 --> 00:39:50,060
<i>these days?</i>

626
00:39:52,547 --> 00:39:55,964
<i>The last time I saw you smile
was back when you were dating Ran.</i>

627
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:06,626
<i>If you ever failed to save something</i>

628
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:08,880
<i>because you had nothing,</i>

629
00:40:10,120 --> 00:40:12,600
<i>you'd realize how valuable money can be.</i>

630
00:40:19,173 --> 00:40:20,900
<i>Let me warn you about one thing.</i>

631
00:40:22,134 --> 00:40:23,810
<i>Your "Angel"</i>

632
00:40:25,277 --> 00:40:28,227
<i>is the most cold-hearted person I've ever met.</i>

633
00:41:14,280 --> 00:41:18,360
[Executive Chairman]

634
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:32,445
Come in.

635
00:41:36,470 --> 00:41:38,010
A high school diploma?

636
00:41:40,548 --> 00:41:42,500
Can you elaborate?

637
00:41:42,500 --> 00:41:44,032
Why did you stop at high school?

638
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:46,157
I had to work.

639
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:48,760
Why didn't you go to college?

640
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:50,100
I need the money.

641
00:41:51,137 --> 00:41:52,860
What happened to your father?

642
00:41:54,040 --> 00:41:55,210
An accident.

643
00:41:56,476 --> 00:41:57,689
Sorry for your loss.

644
00:41:59,210 --> 00:42:00,210
Thank you.

645
00:42:01,020 --> 00:42:03,410
When will you stop giving me short answers?

646
00:42:03,410 --> 00:42:05,480
I have to answer your questions.

647
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:07,885
If you ask, I'll answer.

648
00:42:07,885 --> 00:42:10,000
- Is that wrong?
- No.

649
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,401
But I'm dissatisfied.

650
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:14,681
It feels disrespectful.

651
00:42:15,760 --> 00:42:16,853
I'm sorry,

652
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:20,134
but I don't know how to
elaborate on my answer.

653
00:42:22,200 --> 00:42:23,760
The truth is,

654
00:42:24,600 --> 00:42:27,157
if you just find a rich man to marry,

655
00:42:27,828 --> 00:42:29,640
you won't have to struggle anymore.

656
00:42:29,640 --> 00:42:30,830
Why don't you find one?

657
00:42:32,200 --> 00:42:33,420
I don't have the time.

658
00:42:34,956 --> 00:42:36,946
But if I do, maybe I'll look for one.

659
00:42:38,721 --> 00:42:39,884
Would you like to know

660
00:42:40,653 --> 00:42:42,853
why I had you stationed outside my room?

661
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,030
I don't know.

662
00:42:45,030 --> 00:42:46,440
You don't want to know?

663
00:42:46,440 --> 00:42:47,110
No.

664
00:42:47,110 --> 00:42:48,120
But I want to tell you.

665
00:42:49,320 --> 00:42:50,400
It's alright.

666
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:52,600
I don't need to know.

667
00:42:52,600 --> 00:42:54,790
I only need to follow orders.

668
00:42:54,790 --> 00:42:56,560
You told me to come, so I did.

669
00:42:56,560 --> 00:42:59,440
So this means you'll do everything I say?

670
00:43:00,040 --> 00:43:02,689
Yes, if it's within my duties.

671
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:06,666
I'm not asking you to tango with me.

672
00:43:10,080 --> 00:43:11,760
The reason I want you close to me

673
00:43:13,640 --> 00:43:15,799
is so we can see each other every day.

674
00:43:18,298 --> 00:43:20,392
Maybe it'll help rekindle our old flame.

675
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:25,180
It won't work,
because it was smothered long ago.

676
00:43:28,453 --> 00:43:29,553
Are you sure?

677
00:43:57,720 --> 00:43:59,750
<i>If Ran hadn't told me you were gay,</i>

678
00:43:59,750 --> 00:44:01,880
<i>I would've thought you
had feelings for my sister</i>

679
00:44:01,880 --> 00:44:03,120
<i>since you're this caring.</i>

680
00:44:06,464 --> 00:44:08,630
<i>You don't have time to find a rich man, do you?</i>

681
00:44:08,630 --> 00:44:11,080
<i>Now that I'm rich, are you interested?</i>

682
00:44:11,080 --> 00:44:12,160
<i>No, thank you.</i>

683
00:44:13,520 --> 00:44:16,360
<i>Don't you dare do what I think you'll do.</i>

684
00:44:16,360 --> 00:44:18,020
<i>Are you alright, Ran?</i>

685
00:44:18,020 --> 00:44:19,720
<i>You still love Daran, don't you?</i>

686
00:44:19,720 --> 00:44:22,622
<i>But you won't admit it,
so you put her outside your room.</i>

687
00:44:22,622 --> 00:44:24,700
<i>If you were truly indifferent toward her,</i>

688
00:44:24,700 --> 00:44:26,472
<i>you wouldn't be doing all of this.</i>
